2
00:00:03,609 --> 00:00:06,660
In the cartoon,

3
00:00:06,669 --> 00:00:10,710
a girl tells her mother on the phone that she cannot go back home

4
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:14,430
and spend the National Day holiday together with her parents

5
00:00:14,439 --> 00:00:16,950
because she has booked a sightseeing trip.

6
00:00:16,959 --> 00:00:20,230
The girl looks happy but her aged mother disappointed.

7
00:00:20,239 --> 00:00:24,820
It goes without saying that this cartoon mirrors the relationship

8
00:00:24,829 --> 00:00:28,540
between adult children and their elderly parents.

9
00:00:28,549 --> 00:00:34,230
Nowadays, the increasingly fierce competition compels people to

10
00:00:34,239 --> 00:00:38,930
make every effort to work. And they make use of their precious spare time

11
00:00:38,939 --> 00:00:43,300
to entertain themselves as an escape from stressful reality.

12
00:00:43,309 --> 00:00:48,780
Therefore, they practically have no time to spend together with their parents.

13
00:00:48,789 --> 00:00:51,290
The aged parents, on the other hand,

14
00:00:51,299 --> 00:00:55,330
overwhelmed by a vacuum when they retire from their jobs,

15
00:00:55,339 --> 00:00:59,380
have nothing to do but long for their children to come back.

16
00:00:59,389 --> 00:01:01,350
As far as I can see,

17
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:04,850
the quality of the relationship between parents and children

18
00:01:04,859 --> 00:01:07,480
is of supreme significance.

19
00:01:07,489 --> 00:01:12,830
It is also important that parents feel happy in the knowledge that they are loved.

20
00:01:12,839 --> 00:01:17,320
That is to say, children need to spend more time with their parents

21
00:01:17,329 --> 00:01:20,270
and express love and concern about them.

22
00:01:20,279 --> 00:01:25,520
In addition, it is advisable for the parents to accept the fact that

23
00:01:25,529 --> 00:01:30,220
sooner or later their children will leave them for an independent life.

24
00:01:30,229 --> 00:01:34,820
By looking for social circles of their own and cultivating hobbies

25
00:01:34,829 --> 00:01:38,430
such as writing, painting and singing, elderly parents

26
00:01:38,439 --> 00:01:40,430
will enjoy a more meaningful life in their remaining years.

